    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0635-block-0055",
      "order": 55,
      "text": "neuro-muscular blocking agents (e.g. succinylcholine), cholinergic agonists and \n",
      "bbox": [
        341.98486328125,
        100.78853607177734,
        350.87237548828125,
        375.25848388671875
      ],
      "text_sha256": "def56a8be8eb287abe5893b9c9ebbc5f4383ca122ecef68012d514e90bb1d861"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0635-block-0056",
      "order": 56,
      "text": "peripherally acting cholinesterase inhibitors, e.g. neostigmine. Possible interaction with \n",
      "bbox": [
        351.98236083984375,
        73.9537582397461,
        360.869873046875,
        375.25848388671875
      ],
      "text_sha256": "18f24a7b81d590896873fd557955daf6dcec8b83b15fcb774cc56c38f1056002"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0635-block-0057",
      "order": 57,
      "text": "agents that significantly reduce heart rate, e.g. digoxin, beta blockers, certain calcium-\n",
      "bbox": [
        361.9798583984375,
        87.02581787109375,
        370.86737060546875,
        375.25848388671875
      ],
      "text_sha256": "86006ff9616766fd25b103d638cb3b0ddbb2187bb465e7fd37b7bddebde429d0"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0635-block-0058",
      "order": 58,
      "text": "channel blockers and amiodarone. Caution with concomitant use of drugs known to induce QT \n",
      "bbox": [
        371.97735595703125,
        58.646141052246094,
        380.8648681640625,
        375.25848388671875
      ],
      "text_sha256": "89bda972ab715f7019c2403debe2b212f634e27e50257e7651faea62484b8144"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0635-block-0059",
      "order": 59,
      "text": "prolongation and/or torsade de pointes (manufacturer recommends ECG in such cases). \n",
      "bbox": [
        382.1548767089844,
        93.52083587646484,
        390.86236572265625,
        375.25848388671875
      ],
      "text_sha256": "aca38df624e526841469adc02c0a07245ba945c1c8ae69d1f0adc94de428114c"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0635-block-0060",
      "order": 60,
      "text": "Movement disorders and neuroleptic malignant syndrome have occurred with concomitant use of \n",
      "bbox": [
